raction_method":"brreg_update_feed_v1","snapshot":6}],"summary":{"text":"BOEN FOSS AS is a private limited company registered in Kristiansand S, founded 1978-01-02. BOEN FOSS AS is registered for trading and industrial activities, owning fixed property, and participating in other companies and businesses of any kind through share ownership or otherwise. Its statutory purpose is to own and operate power plants and activities connected with this. It was previously named BOEN BRUK AS until 1998-12-30. Its main industry code is 35.121: production of electricity from hydropower. In its 2025 accounts, total operating income was 16 115 147 NOK and the annual result was 7 732 034 NOK; operating income was up from 15 471 025 NOK in 2024. The annual result rose from 6 637 813 NOK in 2024 to 7 732 034 NOK in 2025. Equity rose from 27 734 184 NOK in 2024 to 35 466 218 NOK in 2025. The register's most recent update was on 2026-06-20 (sisteInnsendteAarsregnskap).","sentences":[{"text":"BOEN FOSS AS is a private limited company registered in Kristiansand S, founded 1978-01-02.","claim_ids":["c1","c3","c5","c7"]},{"text":"BOEN FOSS AS is registered for trading and industrial activities, owning fixed property, and participating in other companies and businesses of any kind through share ownership or otherwise. Its statutory purpose is to own and operate power plants and activities connected with this.","claim_ids":["c11","c10"]},{"text":"It was previously named BOEN BRUK AS until 1998-12-30.","claim_ids":["c21"]},{"text":"Its main industry code is 35.121: production of electricity from hydropower.","claim_ids":["c4"]},{"text":"In its 2025 accounts, total operating income was 16 115 147 NOK and the annual result was 7 732 034 NOK; operating income was up from 15 471 025 NOK in 2024.","claim_ids":["c55","c60","c44"]},{"text":"The annual result rose from 6 637 813 NOK in 2024 to 7 732 034 NOK in 2025.","claim_ids":["c49","c60"]},{"text":"Equity rose from 27 734 184 NOK in 2024 to 35 46